        "ST-01": {
          "title": "Investigate trade_plans.position_id never populated in production (BLG-BE-46)",
          "classification": "autonomous",
          "status": "done",
          "assigned_to": "engine",
          "github_issue": 928,
          "branch": "exec/2026-07-08__release-v6.8/EPIC-01",
          "commit_sha": "4510031529cb12a2c801950b5e074e2a12b7602e",
          "delegation_record_id": null,
          "blocked_since_utc": null,
          "unblock_criteria": null,
          "completed_utc": "2026-07-09T08:10:00Z",
          "acceptance_verified": true,
          "spec_references": [],
          "deviations_filed": true,
          "last_completed_substep": "3.1.A.commit",
          "sign_off_record": {
            "required_by": "Director of Quality",
            "method": "agent_mediated",
            "status": "cleared",
            "findings_applied": [],
            "cleared_utc": "2026-07-09T09:10:00Z"
          },
          "notes": "AC-01: Root cause = workflow gap, not a code defect \u2014 TradePlan.js (pre-trade planning) and TradeEntry.js (position entry) are separate pages with no hand-off; position_id was never sent when a position was created from a drafted plan. AC-02: Fixed via backend-only auto-link in add_position() (position_service.py) \u2014 matches the most recent unlinked draft trade plan by ticker+market and sets position_id + status=active; no UI change, preserving the pre-approved design gate classification. Verified via regression tests in tests/test_position_trade_plan_link.py (4 tests, all passing) exercising link/no-match/lookup-failure/update-failure paths. AC-03: Decision = forward-fix only, no historical backfill of the 11 existing unlinked draft plans (per RISK-01, backfill not required to close; those plans predate the fix and have no reliable ticker/time match to their positions). AC-04: current_roadmap.md SI-02 gate row update is outside this engine's write scope (claude/roadmap/* is prohibited per execution_prompt.md Section 7) \u2014 handoff to the Roadmap Rebalance Engine at the next run roadmap invocation, which can now read the corrected linked-plan count directly via the ST-04 API key rather than self-report. no prior spec applicable"
        },
        "ST-02": {
          "title": "Unvalidated dict keys used as SQL column names in database.update_signal() (BLG-SEC-08)",
