            "cleared_utc": "2026-07-09T09:10:00Z"
          },
          "notes": "AC-01: Added SIGNAL_UPDATABLE_COLUMNS allowlist in database.py; update_signal() now raises ValueError for any dict key outside it before building SQL (defense in depth), and the PATCH /signals/{id} endpoint in main.py pre-validates the same allowlist to return 400 instead of a misleading 404. AC-02: 4 new regression tests added to tests/test_signal_write_sanitization.py confirming rejection of an unrecognised key (including mixed valid/invalid payloads) and that every allowlisted column remains a legal update target. no prior spec applicable"
        },
