          "notes": "AC-01: Key was already provisioned (confirmed working as of 2026-07-06 per prior-session memory) but never formally documented in the API key security register \u2014 added entry #6 this sprint, resolving LP-08 (v6.7 closure carry-forward, 2-cycle-recurring credential gap). Storage: ~/.api_keys as RENDER_API_KEY (backend env var API_KEY); naming mismatch flagged explicitly in the register to prevent recurrence of the prior confusion. AC-02: Used the key directly against production GET /trades and GET /trade-plans to confirm the SI-02 gate condition without self-report: total_trades=20, trade_plans=11, trade_plans_with_position_id=0 (pre-ST-01-fix baseline, matches the 2026-07-08 rebalance finding exactly). AC-04 handoff for ST-01 (updating current_roadmap.md SI-02 gate row) can now use this same direct-read mechanism at the next run roadmap invocation instead of self-report."
